[{"title":"避乱陈仓南山回望三秦追怀淮阴侯信漫赋长句","author":"李汾","text":"凭高四顾战尘昏，鹑野山川自吐吞。\n渭水波涛喧陇阪，散关形势轧兴元。\n旌旗日落黄云戍，弓剑霜寒白草原。\n一饭悠悠从漂母，谁怜国士未酬恩。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2420,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪中过虎牢","author":"李汾","text":"萧萧行李戛弓刀，踏雪行人过虎牢。\n广武山川哀阮籍，黄河襟带控成皋。\n身经戎马心逾壮，天入风霜气更豪。\n横槊赋诗男子事，征西谁为谢诸曹。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2421,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"清明","author":"李汾","text":"鸣珂振毂满重城，春日绵绵老燕莺。\n人在碧鸡坊外住，澹随流水过清明。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2422,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"下第","author":"李汾","text":"学剑攻书漫自奇，回头三十六年非。\n春风万里衡门下，依旧并州一布衣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2423,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"磻溪","author":"李汾","text":"封侯输与曲如钩，冷坐磻溪到白头。\n老妇厨中莫弹铗，白鱼留待跃王舟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2424,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"感寓述史杂诗五十首 其一 苏客卿秦","author":"李汾","text":"游说诸侯获上卿，贾人唇舌事纵横。\n可怜一世痴儿女，争羡腰间六印荣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2425,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"感寓述史杂诗五十首 其二 韩淮阴信","author":"李汾","text":"仗剑淮阴去复还，举头西望识龙颜。\n堂堂竟握真王印，未害男儿辱胯间。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2426,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"感寓述史杂诗五十首 其三 叔孙奉常通","author":"李汾","text":"秦时博士鲁诸生，漏网骊山百丈坑。\n邂逅刘郎习绵蕝，便能弹压汉公卿。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2427,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"感寓述史杂诗五十首 其四 马中令周","author":"李汾","text":"脚踏长安陌上尘，布衣西上欲谁亲。\n君王不省常何策，憔悴新丰一旅人。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2428,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"感寓述史杂诗五十首 其五 远祖雁门武皇","author":"李汾","text":"死心唐室正诸侯，铁马南来隘九州。\n当日三垂冈上意，诸孙空抱腐儒羞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2429,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟张水部行路难","author":"李汾","text":"洛阳行人心欲折，半年西州信音绝。\n弹笔峡口兵尘高，半夜心悬陇山月。\n君不见嗷嗷失群鸟，泪尽眼流血。\n潼关昼闭汉使稀，安得慰我生离别。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2430,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"云溪晓汎图","author":"李汾","text":"晓景澹明月，落影潭西丘。\n晴川挂烟树，光拂云河流。\n枫林入行色，关山生白头。\n羡羡画中人，忆我秦川游。\n君帆渺何许，傥下沧浪洲。\n沧浪吾有约，寄谢同盟鸥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2431,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"古月一篇为裕之赋","author":"李汾","text":"古月天不收，敌君三万秋。\n天孙弄明镜，光涌云间流。\n忆昔放逐江南州，金陵女儿歌棹讴。\n草裹乌纱巾，散著紫绮裘。\n酒酣把玉笛，直欲扪参历井、骑斗牛。\n醉中呼儿摇双舟，吾欲乘流下石头。\n起来茫茫视八极，万里只有元丹丘。\n丹丘子，游人间，风尘何为往复还。\n玉华山人近招我，九日朝帝苍梧山。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2432,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"西归","author":"李汾","text":"扰扰王城足是非，不堪多病决然归。\n只因有口谈时事，几被无心触祸机。\n日暮豺狼当路立，天寒雕鹗傍人飞。\n终南山色明如画，何限春风笋蕨肥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2433,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"避乱西山作","author":"李汾","text":"三月都门昼不开，兵尘一夕捲风回。\n也知周室三川在，谁复秦庭七日哀。\n鸦啄腥风下阳翟，草衔冤血上琴台。\n夷门一把平安火，定逐恒山候骑来。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2434,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"李献甫","text":"银潢淡淡没疏星，一阵凉从雨后生。\n仰看浮云成独卧，数围蛛网络中庭。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2435,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"九龙池春望","author":"李献甫","text":"五年外地看清明，袖手低回过客亭。\n谢絮楚萍无定著，春光如我更飘零。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2436,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"兴庆池书所见","author":"李献甫","text":"短短菰蒲刺水青，翠萍开处鉴波明。\n画船转过垂杨外，水面风来闻乐声。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2437,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"长安行","author":"李献甫","text":"长安道，无人行，黄尘不起生榛荆。\n高山有峰不复险，大河有浪亦已平。\n向来百二秦之形，秪今百二秦之名。\n我闻人固物乃固，人不为力物乃倾。\n将军誓守不誓战，战士避死不避生。\n杀人饱厌敌自去，长安有道谁当行。\n黄尘漫漫愁杀人，但见蔽野鸡群鸣。\n河东游子泪如雨，眼花落日迷秦城。\n长安道，无人行，长安城中若为情。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2438,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"别春辞","author":"李献甫","text":"东皇按辔来何迟，人间二月才芳菲。\n六十日春能几时，不如意事常相随。\n一声啼鴂花片飞，把酒却与春别离。\n春缓归，听我歌，滔滔岁月如流波，贵忧孰与贱乐多。\n吾宁不欲列华鼎、驰鸣珂，香屏倚妓荐绮罗。\n人生赋分有定在，谁能买愁费天和。\n长安市上酒如海，跨驴径上胭脂坡。\n酒酣醉舞双婆娑，春自来去如予何。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2439,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"秋风怨","author":"李献甫","text":"疏星耿耿明天河，夜凉翠幕生微波。\n碧梧委叶傅金井，一夕秋风将奈何。\n春风令人和，秋风感人悲。\n妾愁自与秋风期，秋风争管人别离。\n灯灺垂红粉泥暗，龟甲屏风云影乱。\n络纬吊月啼不断，莲漏压荷夜未半。\n凉飘萧萧入疏竹，枕底寒声碎琼玉。\n敲愁撼睡睡不明，花露盈盈泫鱼目。\n秋风且莫吹，念妾守空闺。\n嫁狗随走鸡随飞，九死莫作荡子妻。\n郎薄倖，妾薄命，花自无言絮无定。\n碧云暮合郎未归，几度妆成掩明镜。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2440,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"河上之役三首 其一","author":"李献甫","text":"河堤一决岂天穷，失在当年固白公。\n谁与麻冈开故道，暂教版籍见山东。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2441,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"河上之役三首 其二","author":"李献甫","text":"新筑河堤要策勋，万人采净北壖薪。\n青青好借曹州柳，旧是中原一段春。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2442,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"河上之役三首 其三","author":"李献甫","text":"万夫卷土障横流，负土成山水未收。\n明日落成真盛事，谁能作赋拟黄楼。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2443,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"围城","author":"李献甫","text":"碧树苍烟起暮云，长安陌上断行人。\n百年王气馀飞观，万里神州隔战尘。\n身与孤云向双阙，愁随落日到咸秦。\n山河大地分明在，莫为时危苦怆神。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2444,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"骤雨","author":"李献甫","text":"龙战云鏖拥日囚，鞭驱雷电走蛟虬。\n望中雨脚横天落，触处湍声卷地流。\n梁苑楼台失炎暑，汉家城阙动高秋。\n若为借得天瓢去，倒泻明河净九州。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2445,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"资圣阁登眺同麻杜诸人赋","author":"李献甫","text":"高阁凌云眼界宽，野烟碧树有无间。\n天边孤鸟飞不尽，陌上行人殊未还。\n魏国几回时事改，汴堤千古夕阳閒。\n愁来重倚阑干望，崧少西头是故山。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2446,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"黄石庙","author":"赵滋","text":"狂豪击车代无人，神石一砭志乃信。\n吹嘘风云遮楚秦，炎精炽然四百春。\n一编尚吝续后尘，江山有待终此身。\n望望久愁横目民，朝阳凄凄霜未休。\n江燕竟来江北游，山回鼎移海横流。\n天风何时清九州，草泥自古跧王侯。\n神弃不恤谁当羞，割牲酾酒空千秋。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2447,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"桃源行","author":"元德明","text":"山中三月山桃开，红霞烂漫无边涯。\n山家藏春藏不得，落花流水人间来。\n忆昔携家窜岩谷，秦人半向长城哭。\n回头尘土失咸阳，矰弋徒劳羡鸿鹄。\n冬裘夏葛存大朴，小国寡民皆乐俗。\n昼永垣篱鸡犬閒，春晴门巷桑榆绿。\n渔郎偶到本无心，仙境何缘得重寻。\n今日武陵图上看，唯见云林深复深。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2448,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送德温同舍赴帘试","author":"元德明","text":"太常侍祠水苍佩，内相夜下金莲烛。\n皇家结网未曾疏，亦有佳人在空谷。\n一从唐赋变辽律，仰视折杨犹雅曲。\n云台勋业一青衫，被发操戈踵相属。\n筋疲力涸仅乃得，墨水一升凡几辱。\n英雄俛首入彀中，举世悉然非子独。\n子家口众亲又老，岁月旨甘须寸禄。\n荐书闻说过南宫，冷暖人情到僮仆。\n我初与子偕计吏，人后人前随碌碌。\n不惭齐客售鼓瑟，颇为荆人悲献玉。\n一诗今日送君行，万里秋风看鸿鹄。\n功名前路知不免，鸡黍后期良未卜。\n锦标无用咤龙头，帛书且当传雁足。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2449,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"元德明","text":"十日山中雨，今朝见夕阳。\n乾坤觉清旷，草棘有辉光。\n竹影摇残滴，松声送晚凉。\n南窗聊自适，无用说羲皇。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2450,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"览镜","author":"元德明","text":"四十宜未老，年年添鬓丝。\n直教随牒去，也是挂冠时。\n台阁多新赋，山林有逸诗。\n悠然一尊酒，满酌不须辞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2451,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"室人生朝","author":"元德明","text":"新酒清浑共，糟床洗盏尝。\n平时唯欲醉，此日重难忘。\n容服惭王霸，山林得孟光。\n白头翁与媪，万事听诸郎。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2452,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"太原古城惠明寺塔秋望","author":"元德明","text":"西山万古壮陪京，一日汾流入废城。\n浩浩市声争晓集，畇畇原隰但秋耕。\n晋公老去诗仍在，越石亡来恨未平。\n千尺浮图暮烟底，瓦盆浊酒为谁倾。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2453,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"薄游同郝漕子玉赋","author":"元德明","text":"全晋山河百战场，登临历历见兴亡。\n夷居狵杂尤堪叹，霸气沈雄亦未量。\n石瓮烟霞诗秀润，骀祠风月酒淋浪。\n书生不是功名具，惭愧山翁问葛疆。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2454,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山中秋夕","author":"元德明","text":"黄卷存馀习，青灯共晚凉。\n只知书味永，不觉鬓丝长。\n老桧千年物，幽兰一国香。\n平生陶靖节，此夕邈相望。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2455,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寄宗人彦达","author":"元德明","text":"杯酒无缘接旧欢，空将书尺问平安。\n要君知我诗成处，落日西风正倚阑。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2456,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"榴华","author":"元德明","text":"山茶赤黄桃绛白，戎葵米囊不入格。\n庭中忽见安石榴，叹息花中有真色。\n生红一撮掌中看，模写虽工更觉难。\n诗到黄州隔千里，画家辛苦费铅丹。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2457,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过凤皇山","author":"元德明","text":"凤皇闻说似天坛，北去南来马上看。\n想得松声满岩谷，秋风无际海波寒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2458,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"瓶形岭早发","author":"元德明","text":"海云萧瑟雪花乾，人在羊肠百八盘。\n閒客不知名利苦，见时应作画中看。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2459,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寒食再游福田寺","author":"元德明","text":"春山寂寂掩禅扉，复岭盘盘入翠微。\n布袜青鞋供胜践，粥鱼斋鼓荐玄机。\n日烘幽径绿烟煖，风定晓枝红雨稀。\n曾是西堂读书客，不应啼鸟也催归。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2460,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"家园假山","author":"元德明","text":"八尺飞来峰，苍然立于独。\n细看甲乙字，疑是平泉族。\n山非一草石，见石山亦足。\n便恐东岫云，来我檐下宿。\n今朝凿盆池，明朝种松菊。\n自笑住山人，何时返岩谷。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2461,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"同侯子晋赋雁","author":"元德明","text":"沈沈江浦云，浩浩朔漠雪。\n微生几寒暑，翅老飞欲折。\n楼中见新过，夕照送明灭。\n欹枕数声来，疏窗耿残月。\n悲鸣或天性，南北随所惬。\n谁念孤旅人，年年为愁绝。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2462,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寒林图为侯子晋赋","author":"元德明","text":"川光茫茫风景暮，一雪无情天地素。\n长安闭门千万家，亦有行人踏长路。\n新丰烟火灞桥水，画史工作荒寒趣。\n雪中故事知几何，偏识诗翁忍寒处。\n君不见淮西城下鹅鹳鸣，官军夜斫吴家营。\n只如党家粗俗亦不恶，银烛金荷天未明。\n拈出雪诗三十韵，蹇驴席帽可怜生。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2463,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"赠答彦文相过之什","author":"元德明","text":"剥啄谁叩门，开门得吾友。\n握手一大笑，慰我离群久。\n之子富才具，事业可力取。\n瞻望青松姿，衰迟愧蒲柳。\n金闺满鸳鹭，什伯自为偶。\n寂莫林野人，过从但邻叟。\n盘餐无兼味，笋蕨才适口。\n穷达俱偶然，相逢且杯酒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2464,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"元德明","text":"往时见白发，谈笑轻岁月。\n谁谓明镜里，萧萧不胜镊。\n山林蹉跎久，世虑初未绝。\n触物重兴怀，忽忽不自惬。\n遭逢有奇耦，才用随巧拙。\n如何杜陵叟，自比稷与契。\n茫茫拊尘编，何时卒吾业。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2465,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"秋暮王氏园亭","author":"元德明","text":"细径云林底，危亭涧水湄。\n秋先殒黄叶，寒未老红葵。\n嚼句幽禽答，寻花晚蝶随。\n无人共幽兴，思与野僧期。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2466,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"六言","author":"元德明","text":"北阙三台五省，东山万壑千岩。\n琴书中有真味，风月外无多谈。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2467,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山园梨叶有青红相半者戏作一诗","author":"元德明","text":"霜轻霜重偶然中，一叶虽殊万叶同。\n不信世间閒草木，解随儿女作青红。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2468,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"诗","author":"元德明","text":"少有吟诗癖，吟来欲白头。\n科名不肯换，家事几曾忧。\n含咀将谁语，研摩若自雠。\n百年閒伎俩，直到死时休。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2469,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"尊酒","author":"元德明","text":"土灰论远计，木石笑浮生。\n但有一尊酒，何须千载名。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2470,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"忆山中二绝句 其一","author":"元德明","text":"东寺留连饮，张园烂漫游。\n儿童望归路，一日几登楼。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2471,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"忆山中二绝句 其二","author":"元德明","text":"秋色山中好，山翁醉不回。\n不知篱下菊，霜后几丛开。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2472,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山中雨后","author":"元德明","text":"绕屋湍声转，临崖老树摧。\n雷轰一雨去，云擘两山开。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2473,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"元德明","text":"张翰一杯酒，林逋千首诗。\n性惟便自适，材敢论时施。\n狡兔从三窟，鹪鹩分一枝。\n青山有佳色，只似往年时。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2474,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"发冀州留别恩禅师","author":"元德明","text":"诗拙非同社，情亲本故乡。\n共知成远别，且复暂相将。\n池古莲花净，窗深桧叶香。\n何时重携酒，来宿赞公房。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2475,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"贵公子咏","author":"元德明","text":"高堂红烛鼓声齐，舞遍纤腰月未西。\n一曲缠头一双锦，骅骝空自惜障泥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2476,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"莲叶观音恩禅师所藏同路宣叔赋","author":"元德明","text":"瑞相分明一叶中，华严性海共圆通。\n补陀自有丹青变，画史区区可得工。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2477,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"谢张使君梦弼馈春肉","author":"元德明","text":"牙猪肋厚一尺玉，盐花入深蒸脱骨。\n韭芽蓼甲春满盘，走送茅斋慰幽独。\n山人食贫才一粥，几被艾生嘲苜蓿。\n食前方丈非素怀，颇忆悬貆绕高屋。\n呼来邻叟共一饱，为说使君方继肉。\n饥民待哺今几家，无策赞君惭此腹。\n区区一肉见歌咏，说食书生良未足。\n却愁今夕梦寐间，有物踏破园蔬绿。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2478,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"仙鸡诗","author":"元德明","text":"老雄健斗夸擅场，韩郎抱归神色扬。\n岂知黠儿出徼倖，毒手一发不得妨。\n毳毛散洒尚可养，利嘴一哆何由张。\n青囊道人何许来，自言救药吾有方。\n垂髯噀水濯残血，半喙随手生新黄。\n筠笼半开闻腷膊，草冠已往徒惊忙。\n神仙世有宁虚荒，惜哉诡激不可量。\n世人鸷勇天且劓，况于物也资强梁。\n敷荣枯蘖变金石，未若与世针膏肓。\n何须变化示狡狯，知君办作淮南王。\n蓬莱东望云茫茫，爱而不见心为狂。\n刀圭不愿换凡骨，且欲共醉无何乡。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2479,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"灯下读林和靖诗","author":"元德明","text":"落叶落复落，清霜今几番。\n疏灯照茅屋，山月入颓垣。\n老爱寒花淡，幽嫌宿鸟喧。\n卷中林处士，相对两忘言。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2480,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"观西岩张永淳画雁","author":"元德明","text":"惨淡经营下笔难，画成不似卷中看。\n知君连夜江湖梦，折苇萧萧沙水寒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2481,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"从赵敷道觅石榴","author":"元德明","text":"仙人囊中五色露，得种昔与蒲桃俱。\n猩猩染花开五月，已觉秋实悬庭除。\n张园一酸齿欲裂，君家两株蜜不如。\n竹马儿童厌梨栗，绿囊聊为剥红珠。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2482,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪行","author":"元德明","text":"五更驴背满靴霜，残雪离离草树荒。\n身在景中无句写，错教人比孟襄阳。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2483,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"龙眠画马","author":"元德明","text":"骊黄求马世皆然，灭没存亡自一天。\n当日盐车人不识，只今空向画中传。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2484,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}}]